ey_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「噗噗！噗噗！」黃面蜂（狩獵蜂的一種）正在野地裡","n":24,"ssz":"................2......."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"上一課，我們學會找證據，看證據能支持什麼判斷。\n這一課，文章提出「昆蟲會不會思考」的問題，並提供兩項觀察。閱讀時，我們要找出真正能回答問題的證據，再把證據合起來，看看能形成什麼結論。","n":91,"ssz":".1.......................1..........1......................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"上一課，我們學會找證據，看證據能支持什麼判斷。","n":23,"ssz":".1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課，文章提出「昆蟲會不會思考」的問題，並提供兩項觀察。閱讀時，我們要找出真正能回答問題的證據，再把證據合起來，看看能形成什麼結論。","n":67,"ssz":".1..........1......................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、先鎖定問題","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（圖形），文字流中被勾中的選項前沒有 □","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章主要想回答什麼問題？（單選）","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"捲葉象鼻蟲和黃面蜂如何為幼蟲準備住處或食物？","n":22,"ssz":".....1...........1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"昆蟲是否只會依循本能，還是也可能因情況改變做法？","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"捲葉象鼻蟲和黃面蜂的行為有哪些相同和不同？","n":21,"ssz":".....1.........1.1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、找出行為怎麼改變","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"㈠捲葉象鼻蟲：哪一項才是關鍵證據？","n":17,"ssz":"........1........